<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30749" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔθειρα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hair</i>, poet. Noun, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>, and always in pl., either of <i>a horse's mane</i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.42
			</span></i>; or of the <i>horsehair crest</i> on helmets, <i><span class="en">
				16.795
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.382
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later sg.,
				<i>hair of the head</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				5(4).9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				1062
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1124
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				5.91
			</span></i>, etc.: also pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ven.</u>
				228
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				175
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				632
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				3.1376
			</span></i>, etc.; of a lion's <i>mane</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.244
			</span></i>; porcupine's <i>quills</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.395
			</span></i>; a bird's <i>feathers</i>, ib. <i><span class="en">
				123
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρόκου θυόεσσαν
			ἔθειραν</span>, of the <i>filiform stigmas</i> of the
			saffron, <i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				2.68
			</span></i>.</div>
